 and the rock surface beneath it.", 'The white refrigerator is now taller and filled with records, cassettes, and CDs, replacing the books. The shot is taken from the left, and the brown floor has been changed to a white one, creating a stark contrast with the white fridge.', 'The scene now shows the animal in the pool with trees behind it, surrounded by a backdrop of blue water bodies, and only one animal remains in the pool.', 'The sliding door has been changed to a grill design with white finishing, replacing the glass doors. The wooden floor has been added, and the walls have been painted blue. The background now features a wooden fence, trees, and a clear sky, drawing more attention to the door.', 'The scene now shows a group of German Shepherd dogs playing in a snowy field, viewed from a wider perspective with a wooden fence and additional trees in the background. The dogs are spread out, enjoying the snow, and the overall setting is more expansive, capturing a broader view of the snowy landscape.', 'The final scene shows a single monkey sitting in the foreground, with a fence added in the background. The monkey is positioned in a relaxed posture, and the background has been changed to include a fence, altering the original setting.', "The scene now features three puppies, including one with black fur, sitting together on a rug. The puppies are positioned closer together, with one of them having a speckled pattern on its head and looking slightly downward. The puppies are now sitting on a tiled floor, and a human's calf is visible behind them.", 'The perfume bottle has been transformed into a cylindrical shape with a transparent body and a gold lid, giving it a sleek and modern appearance. The original black and gold package has been added to the scene, complementing the new bottle design.', 'The scene now features only two Swell bottles, one brown and one gray, with the brown bottle positioned to the right of the gray one. The bottles are displayed on clear acrylic stands, with a closer, more detailed view that emphasizes their textured surfaces. The background has been changed to a light gray, providing a neutral backdrop that highlights the bottles.']
