street in the background and a fence. The dog is positioned further away, giving a sense of distance, and the setting has shifted from a grassy area to a street environment.', "The final scene shows a close-up of two smaller black and brown puppies, with the brown one licking the other. The brown dog's tongue is prominently exposed, and the background has been removed, focusing solely on the two puppies.", 'The final scene shows a snowy landscape with a man and several dogs chasing each other. The camera angle is far away, capturing the vast expanse of the snow-covered terrain. The sea background from the original image has been removed, leaving only the snowy landscape and the man with the dogs.']
