apples.', 'The bookcase has been widened and painted brown, with books and decorative items neatly arranged on each shelf. A television has been added to the top shelf, and a small table has been placed in front of the bookcase. Additional decorations have been added to enhance the display. The scene is captured from a distance angle, showing the bookcase against light beige walls, creating a more spacious and inviting atmosphere.', "The final scene shows a large dog with a brown muzzle standing on a background of green grass. The dog's tongue is sticking out, and the image is a closer shot focused on the front part of the dog, with no other dogs or a pool present.", 'The scene now shows a dog with a blue collar standing in front of a white house, with another dog featuring big ears pointing down and all four legs visible, viewed from the front.', 'The scene now shows two antelopes grazing on a slope, with one animal positioned at a different angle than the original. The background has been altered to include a ground view, providing a clearer perspective of the terrain beneath the animals.', 'The scene now shows a beautifully decorated bed with a pink cover, where the girl is lying on it, wearing a night dress. The perspective has shifted to a side angle, and the background has been changed to a brown setting, creating a cozy and intimate atmosphere.', 'The man is now seated in a chair to the right of the table, with a large, fluffy dog standing to his left. The background has been modified to include shelves filled with books and other items, adding a sense of depth and context to the scene.', 'The image now features a folded file with a leather finish, placed on a clean white background, with the knife removed from the scene.', 'The final scene shows a black and white photo of dogs harnessed to a sled, howling, with two additional people joining the group. The perspective has shifted to a side angle, and the background now features a snowy landscape.']
