he kneepads, which are neatly arranged and clearly visible.', 'The final scene shows a closer view of the dogs pulling the sled through the snow, with their tracks more prominent and the surrounding landscape less visible.', 'The scene transitions to a white-themed kitchen with white walls, where the dining room view is removed. The flowers are now white, and the floor is widened and lightened to take in more of the room.', 'The final scene shows a close with storage cabinets, replacing the bookshelf. The close has a door with a door knob added for easy access.', 'The final scene shows a monitor of a computer instead of the wash basin, with a rectangular shape and a black background.', 'The scene now features two smaller, similar-looking dogs, likely of the same breed, in a more focused setting. The background has been changed to a grey wall, and the ground is now dirt instead of the original wooden floor.', 'The brown notebook is now open, revealing its pages, and the background has been changed to white.', 'The image now shows a pink table with blue dumbbells placed on it. The pink lipstick and lip liner are standing upright, and a pink water bottle is also present. The blue dumbbells and objects are further away from the camera in the right photo, and a brown wall background has been added to the right photo. The left photo still shows the original items without any background.', 'The final scene shows a mountaineous region with snow covering the peaks, a lone animal standing on a cliff, and no buildings present.']
